..
	This is *NOT* a RST file but the syntax has been chosen so
	that it may become an RST file at some later date.

.. vinyl_vsc_begin::	disk
	:oneliner:	Disk Stevedore Counters
	:order:		50

.. vinyl_vsc:: c_req
	:type:	counter
	:level:	info
	:oneliner:	Allocator requests

	Number of times the storage has been asked to provide a disk extent.

.. vinyl_vsc:: c_fail
	:type:	counter
	:level:	info
	:oneliner:	Allocator failures

	Number of times the storage has failed to provide a disk extent.

.. vinyl_vsc:: c_bytes
	:type:	counter
	:level:	info
	:format: bytes
	:oneliner:	Bytes allocated

	Number of total bytes allocated by this storage.

.. vinyl_vsc:: c_freed
	:type:	counter
	:level:	info
	:format: bytes
	:oneliner:	Bytes freed

	Number of total bytes returned to this storage.

.. vinyl_vsc:: g_alloc
	:type:	gauge
	:level:	info
	:oneliner:	Allocations outstanding

	Number of disk extents outstanding.

.. vinyl_vsc:: g_bytes
	:type:	gauge
	:level:	info
	:format: bytes
	:oneliner:	Bytes outstanding

	Number of bytes allocated from the storage.

.. vinyl_vsc:: g_space
	:type:	gauge
	:level:	info
	:format: bytes
	:oneliner:	Bytes available

	Number of bytes left in the storage.

.. vinyl_vsc:: g_free_ext
	:type:	gauge
	:level:	diag
	:oneliner:	Free extents

	Number of free extents. A high number relative to g_space
	indicates fragmentation.

.. vinyl_vsc:: c_restored
	:type:	counter
	:level:	info
	:oneliner:	Objects restored

	Number of objects restored from the storage when the cache
	process started after a clean shutdown.

.. vinyl_vsc_end::	disk
